# 统一行尾，防止 Windows core.autocrlf=true 把 shell/python 还原成 CRLF。
# 血泪教训：git restore 后 *.sh 变 CRLF → `set -euo pipefail\r` → dash 报
# "pipefail: invalid option name"，容器根本没起来，脚本秒退。
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.pt binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.tar binary
*.bag binary
